  hook states (0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0); "false" = locked off the true bit phase

  payload                      locks   false  wrong sf phase
  speech                           8       0               7
  idle                             8       0               7
  idle + one data card             8       4               3
  speech + one data card           8       4               3

